    {
      "number": "517",
      "text": "下列除法做得对不对？\n1) $-36:2=-18$；\n2) $60:(-1.5)=-4$；\n3) $2.7:(-1)=2.7$；\n4) $-7.5:(-5)=1.5$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "518",
      "text": "求商：\n1) $-38:19$；\n2) $45:(-15)$；\n3) $-36:(-6)$；\n4) $270:(-9)$；\n5) $-5.1:(-17)$；\n6) $650:(-1.3)$；\n7) $-4.4:4$；\n8) $-8.6:(-43)$；\n9) $48.1:(-48.1)$；\n10) $-950:9.5$；\n11) $-5.42:(-27.1)$；\n12) $10.01:(-1.3)$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "519",
      "text": "计算：\n1) $-4\\cdot(-5)-(-30):6$；\n2) $15:(-15)-(-24):8$；\n3) $-8\\cdot(-3+12):36+2$；\n4) $2.3\\cdot(-6-4):5$；\n5) $(-8+32):(-6)-7$；\n6) $-21+(-3-4+5):(-2)$；\n7) $-6\\cdot4-84:(-3.8+1.7)$；\n8) $(-6+6.4-10):(-8)\\cdot(-3)$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "520",
      "text": "求下列各式的值：\n1) $(3m+6m):9$，当$m=-12,-5.96$时；\n2) $(5.2a-5.2b):5.2$，当$a=-27,b=-3.64$时.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "521",
      "text": "求下列各式的值：\n1) $(-23\\cdot5):5$；\n2) $[32\\cdot(-7)]:32$；\n3) $(-9\\cdot7.4):(-9)$；\n4) $[-8\\cdot(-9.1)]:9.1$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "522",
      "text": "求商：\n1) $87x$和87；\n2) $6.2m$和6.2；\n3) $-3.7k$和$-3.7$；\n4) $9m$和$m$；\n5) $-41k$和$k$；\n6) $-1.9x$和$x$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "523",
      "text": "求证：当变数为任何值时，下列等式都成立：\n1) $-28k:(-7)=4k$；\n2) $64x:(-8)=-8x$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "524",
      "text": "解方程并检验：\n1) $-x\\cdot4=-100$；\n2) $3\\cdot(-x)=-27$；\n3) $-0.1y=33$；\n4) $10\\cdot(x-4)=-80$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "525",
      "text": "我想一个数，扩大5倍，再减去2.7，结果得$-21.7$，我想的是什么数？",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "526",
      "text": "按图113列方程并求解.",
